 Briland House, Cottages and Kings Beach Homes; oceanfront pool, tennis, padel and pickleball; Conde Nast Traveler Gold List 2026; Island Inns: \"Perched on a bluff overlooking the turquoise Atlantic Ocean\" (https://www.islandinns.com/coral-sands, accessed 2026-10-02)","si":["romance","tropical","family","sports"],"commission":"hotel","wells":["activities","eat","stay"],"draw_rank":4,"tier_absent_reason":"not-established","source":"https://www.coralsands.com/","accessed":"2026-10-02","wells_basis":"full pass 2026-10-05, additive — text"},{"name":"Dunmore Town","blurb":"\"A quintessential seaside town in Harbour Island, where everyone knows everyone. Where you wake up to the sound of roosters and leave a trail of footprints in pink sand. The pace here is slow, irresistibly so.\" Its \"picket-fenced, pastel-painted cottages\" sit \"a breezy five-minute pedal away\" from Pink Sands Resort (https://www.mrandmrssmith.com/luxury-hotels/pink-sands-resort, accessed 2026-10-02).","si":["culture","senior","family"],"wells":["activities","shop","stay"],"draw_rank":2,"tier_absent_reason":"not-sold","source":"https://www.bahamas.com/islands/eleuthera-harbour-island","accessed":"2026-10-02","wells_basis":"full pass 2026-10-05, additive — text","commission":"entry non-commissionable (curated) - guide or island tour operator sells around it","commission_basis":"2026-10-05 lane label by the jewel''s nature (CC review) - a landmark, park or natural sight - free or a park fee; a guided island tour is the paid route"},{"name":"Pink Sands Resort","blurb":"\"Bahamas'' iconic ultra-luxury island resort\" set across 20 acres along 3 miles of pink sand beach; one- and two-bedroom cottages, villas and houses with pools; Malcolm 51 and Blue Bar & Kitchen; Mr & Mrs Smith lists \"32 standalone cottages, villas and residences\" and says the island has \"more golf carts than cars\" (https://www.mrandmrssmith.com/luxury-hotels/pink-sands-resort, accessed 2026-10-02)","tier":"ultra","si":["romance","tropical","ultra","wellness"],"commission":"hotel","wells":["activities","beauty","eat","stay"],"draw_rank":3,"source":"https://www.pinksandsresort.com/accommodations/","accessed":"2026-10-02","wells_basis":"full pass 2026-10-05, additive — text"},{"name":"St. Johns Anglican Church","blurb":"\"the oldest religious foundation in The Bahamas... Its pink and white building dates back to 1768, and the Loyalists worshiped here as early as the mid1700s.\" Dunmore Street; (242) 333-2178","si":["culture","pilgrimage","senior"],"wells":["activities"],"draw_rank":5,"tier_absent_reason":"not-sold","source":"https://www.bahamas.com/vendor/st-johns-anglican-church","accessed":"2026-10-02","commission":"entry (site ticket, non-commissionable) - guide (licensed local guide) sells around it","commission_basis":"2026-10-05 lane label by the jewel''s nature (CC review) - a religious or heritage site - the entry is non-commissionable; a guided visit is the paid route"},{"name":"Valentines Dive Center","blurb":"PADI-certified; scuba through coral reefs and shipwrecks, snorkelling tours \"designed for families and beginners\", half- or full-day private boat charters, and \"Swim with the Pigs\" in Spanish Wells; equipment included; S-20193 Bay Street","si":["diveglobal","ocean","family","wildlife"],"commission":"operator","wells":["activities","gear","move","shop"],"draw_rank":6,"tier_absent_reason":"does-not-compete","source":"https://www.valentinesdive.com/","accessed":"2026-10-02","wells_basis":"full pass 2026-10-05, additive — text"},{"name":"Bonefishing the Harbour Island flats","blurb":"\"some of the best fishing is very close to the island\"; \"The bonefish around Harbour Island can be very spooky, and to be successful, anglers must rely on stealth and precise casting\"; guide Patrick Roberts, third generation, whose family has \"navigated the waters around Harbour Island for decades\"","si":["ocean","adventure","sports"],"commission":"guide","wells":["activities"],"draw_rank":7,"tier_absent_reason":"does-not-compete","source":"https://elevenexperience.com/explore/bahamian-rhapsody","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"name":"Valentines Marina","blurb":"\"the largest marina in Harbour Island\", for \"yachts up to 200 ft\" plus sport-fishing boats and day-trippers; fuel, full electric, RO water, 24/7 security; VHF 16 monitored 7 AM-7 PM","si":["yacht","sailing","ocean"],"commission":"venue","wells":["activities","move","stay"],"draw_rank":8,"tier_absent_reason":"not-established","source":"https://www.valentinesresort.com/marina","accessed":"2026-10-02","wells_basis":"full pass 2026-10-05, additive — text"},{"name":"Valentines Resort & Marina","blurb":"boutique suites at 1 Bay Street blending \"barefoot luxury with genuine island charm\"; current offer: fourth night free on 3+ night stays","si":["tropical","yacht","romance"],"commission":"hotel","wells":["eat","shop","stay"],"draw_rank":9,"tier_absent_reason":"not-established","source":"https://www.valentinesresort.com/","accessed":"2026-10-02","wells_basis":"full pass 2026-10-05, additive — text"},{"name":"Conch & Coconut Bahamas","blurb":"locally owned concierge founded by native islander Shaq Gibson: private Intrepid boat charters (sunset, deep-sea, bottom and spearfishing), VIP airport transfers, pink golf carts, North Eleuthera land tours, private chefs, fishing guides and air charters; office on Dunmore Street","si":["ocean","adventure","romance","privatejet"],"commission":"DMC","wells":["activities","move","fly"],"draw_rank":10,"tier_absent_reason":"does-not-compete","source":"https://conchandcoconutbahamas.com/","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"name":"Briland by Sea Boat Experience","blurb":"Pink Sands Resort''s boat charter, curated by Conch & Coconut: snorkelling at Devil''s Backbone reef and swimming with turtles, ending at the Ocean Swings; also a 2-hour Sunset Harbour Cruise","si":["ocean","diveglobal","wildlife","romance"],"commission":"bundle","wells":["activities","move","stay"],"draw_rank"