r, quiet), but Statia IS in the hurricane belt - favour December-April (dry, reliable) and be weather-aware August-October (peak storm months).","source":"bluewaterdivetravel.com","si_tag":"diveglobal"},{"q":"Do I need permits for Statia, and what do they cost?","a":"Yes - a STENAPA marine tag for diving and a $10 hiking permit for the Quill/Boven trails, both funding conservation; buy them through your dive centre or STENAPA.","source":"travelwithhello.com","si_tag":"hiking"},{"q":"Which Statia sites and experiences should I not miss?","a":"The heritage reefs over cannons and anchors, the award-winning macro life, the island''s wreck dives, a Quill crater hike, and historic Oranjestad with Fort Oranje - a rare dive-plus-history pairing.","source":"statiapark.org","si_tag":"diveglobal"},{"q":"Is Statia a liveaboard destination?","a":"No - it''s a shore-and-day-boat heritage-dive island. Liveaboards may route past Statia on St. Kitts itineraries, but there is no Statia-based liveaboard - book a resort-and-dive-centre trip.","source":"bluewaterdivetravel.com","si_tag":"diveglobal"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Sint Eustatius (Statia) Travel Guide: Heritage Diving, The Quill & Fort Oranje","meta_description":"Plan Sint Eustatius (Statia) - the Caribbean''s living underwater museum: 36+ dive sites over 18th-century cannons and anchors in a marine park bigger than the island, award-topping macro, the Quill rainforest volcano and historic Oranjestad.","slug":"sint-eustatius","primary_keyword":"Sint Eustatius Statia diving","long_tail":["Statia diving STENAPA marine park","The Quill volcano hike","Sint Eustatius blue beads","Fort Oranje Oranjestad","best macro diving Caribbean","Golden Rock Dive Center"],"search_language":"nl","local_keywords":["Statia","Sint Eustatius","The Quill","Mazinga","Oranjestad","Fort Oranje","STENAPA","Golden Rock","blauwe kralen"],"hreflang":["en","nl"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-07-30","attribution":{"author":{"type":